    {
      "id": "story_2441_p0_c0",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "ある朝、農場主は彼のめんどりが金の卵を産んだことを発見しました。",
      "text_en": "One morning, a farmer discovered that his hen had laid a golden egg.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ある\" data-defn=\"there is / to exist (inanimate)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ある</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"あさ\" data-defn=\"あさ (word)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">朝</span><rt>あさ</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"のうじょう\" data-defn=\"farm (agriculture)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">農場</span><rt>のうじょう</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"しゅ\" data-defn=\"chief/main/principal/important; main secondary or supporting role (in kyogen)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">主</span><rt>しゅ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"かれ\" data-defn=\"that/that thing; that person\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">彼</span><rt>かれ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"の\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (&#x27;s / of)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">の</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"めんど\" data-defn=\"troublesome/bothersome (めんどい)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">めんど</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"り\" data-defn=\"advantage/benefit/profit/interest\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">り</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"が\" data-defn=\"subject marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">が</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"かね\" data-defn=\"かね (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">金</span><rt>かね</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"の\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (&#x27;s / of)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">の</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"たまご\" data-defn=\"たまご (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">卵</span><rt>たまご</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"を\" data-defn=\"direct object marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\