    {
      "id": "story_2441_p0_c2",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "それ以来、彼は毎朝金の卵を見つけ、ますます金持ちになりました。",
      "text_en": "From then on, he found a golden egg every morning, and he grew richer and richer.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"それ\" data-defn=\"それ (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">それ</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"いらい\" data-defn=\"since/henceforth\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">以来</span><rt>いらい</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"かれ\" data-defn=\"that/that thing; that person\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">彼</span><rt>かれ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"まいあさ\" data-defn=\"まいあさ (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">毎朝</span><rt>まいあさ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"かね\" data-defn=\"かね (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">金</span><rt>かね</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"の\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (&#x27;s / of)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">の</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"たまご\" data-defn=\"たまご (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">卵</span><rt>たまご</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"を\" data-defn=\"direct object marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">を</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"みつけ\" data-defn=\"to discover/to find (e.g. an error in a book)/to come across/to detect/to spot; to lo (見つける)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">見つけ</span><rt>みつけ</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ますます\" data-defn=\"increasingly/more and more/decreasingly (when declining)/less and less\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">ますます</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"かねもち\" data-defn=\"かねもち (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">金持ち</span><rt>かねもち</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"に\" data-defn=\"target / time / direction marker (to/at/in)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">に</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"なり\" data-defn=\"to become/to get/to grow/to be/to reach/to attain; to result in/to prove to be (なる)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">なり</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ました\" data-defn=\"verb polite suffix (past: did / -ed)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ました</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
      "start": 12.02,
      "end": 18.32,
      "duration": 6.3
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2441_p0_c3",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "text": "しかし、農場主はさらに貪欲になっていきました。",
      "text_en": "But the farmer also grew greedier and greedier.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"しかし\" data-defn=\"しかし (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">しかし</span><rt></rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"のうじょう\" data-defn=\"farm (agriculture)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">農場</span><rt>のうじょう</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"しゅ\" data-defn=\"chief/main/principal/important; main secondary or supporting role (in kyogen)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">主</span><rt>しゅ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"さらに\" data-defn=\"furthermore/again/after all/more and more/moreover/even more\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">さらに</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"どんよく\" data-defn=\"avarice/greed/covetousness; raga (desire)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">貪欲</span><rt>どんよく</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"に\" data-defn=\"target / time / direction marker (to/at/in)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">に</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"なっ\" data-defn=\"to become/to get/to grow/to be/to reach/to attain; to result in/to prove to be (なる)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">なっ</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"て\" data-defn=\"conjunctive particle (and / -ing)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">て</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"いき\" data-defn=\"reverence/awe/fear (いく)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">いき</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ました\" data-defn=\"verb polite suffix (past: did / -ed)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ました</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
